WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:27.569 align:start position:0%
 
[Applause]  hello everyone my name is Martina Selene  and that is Yanni and I'm gonna tell you  all about that in a moment but let me  first you say that it feels so great to  be here on this stage I'm just so happy  to finally be here and get to show you  all this game that we made this whole  thing called unravel I'm the creative  director at the cold wood we're under  the studio made up of 14 people from you  know in northern Sweden and I think that  games are really powerful things they  have the ability to grab you and move  you in a way that few other art forms  can and that gives us as game makers a  certain responsibility I think we should  try to do more than to just entertain an  arrival was created in that spirit it  was born out of the need to make  something more personal  something with a heart it's a puzzle  platformer where you play as a little  character made of yarn which unravels as  you move and the yarn it represents love  and the bonds that we make and it  unravels because that's what happens  when we were separated from what we love  in this game you are the red thread that  runs through someone's life trying to  tie all their missing pieces back  together now I made most of this design  while I was on a camping trip with my  family way out in the countryside I was  so full of ideas but I didn't have a lot  of tools to work with out there so I  figured I could just kind of like act  out the gameplay and that's how how your  knee came to be and I actually brought  him with me  hi know I created this little dog with  some old metal wire that I found in some  yarn that I managed to borrow and then I  just like I wonder around in the woods I  was putting your knee in different  situations and snapping pictures and  figuring out fun ways that you could use  your yarn and I wanted all game to feel  just like that - like it's an  exploration is a quest where you have to  be clever and creative to find the  proper path and the game is centered on  yarny this this little character was on  a big journey and accomplishing big  things despite being so small the  gameplay is all physics based you have  to find the way forward and overcome all  these obstacles that you'll come across  and those problems can have simple  solutions like using your yarn to swing  across a gap or sometimes things might  get more complex so when you look back  at that tangled and winding we belong  left behind you have to stop and wonder  how you ever got there it's kind of like  life I mean I certainly didn't see  myself standing here today back when I  was playing with yarny out in the woods  two summers ago but here I am and I am  really really glad that I finally get to  share this name with you all unravel  thank you  unravel means a lot too is a cold would  we we put our hearts into this and we  hope that when you play it you will feel  that so thank you and enjoy  [Applause]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Applause]

